WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.115 --> 00:00:16.713
Peter and Benjamin hopped past the shop.

2
00:00:16.714 --> 00:00:20.173
Suddenly Peter stopped.

3
00:00:20.174 --> 00:00:26.429
"Look!" he said. "Candy! Let's get some."

4
00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:29.997
"Do you have any money?" Benjamin asked.

5
00:00:29.998 --> 00:00:33.519
"No," Peter said. "Do you?"

6
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:39.431
Benjamin sighed. "No."

7
00:00:39.432 --> 00:00:43.232
The bunnies hopped away sadly.

8
00:00:43.233 --> 00:00:46.309
Then Peter saw something else.

9
00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:49.798
"An old boot!" he cried.

10
00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:52.714
Benjamin looked at the boot.

11
00:00:52.715 --> 00:00:55.510
"It's a nice brown boot.

12
00:00:55.511 --> 00:00:58.357
Let's take it to the shopkeeper."

13
00:00:58.358 --> 00:01:00.407
"Yes!" Peter said.

14
00:01:00.408 --> 00:01:10.061
"Then he will give us candy!"

15
00:01:10.068 --> 00:01:14.355
The bunnies dragged the boot to the shop.

16
00:01:14.356 --> 00:01:19.379
The shopkeeper frowned. "One boot?

17
00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.214
What can I do with one boot?"

18
00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:24.803
"You can sell it," Peter said.

19
00:01:24.804 --> 00:01:29.116
"You can put things in it," Benjamin said.

20
00:01:29.117 --> 00:01:36.482
The shopkeeper looked at the boot again.

21
00:01:36.483 --> 00:01:41.655
"Okay," he said. "I will take it."

22
00:01:41.656 --> 00:01:46.160
The shopkeeper took the boot.

23
00:01:46.161 --> 00:01:50.198
Peter and Benjamin got some candy.

24
00:01:50.199 --> 00:01:57.968
The bunnies were happy now.

25
00:01:57.969 --> 00:02:01.573
As they hopped away, they saw a mouse.

26
00:02:01.574 --> 00:02:10.307
"My house is gone!" she cried.

27
00:02:10.308 --> 00:02:15.825
"It is an old brown boot."
